{"id":"32253bde8f000c05","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-martingale-maximal-inequality.md","title":"上鞅最大不等式","display":"thm-martingale-maximal-inequality — 上鞅最大不等式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-martingale-maximal-inequality","aliases":["43-thm-martingale-maximal-inequality"],"display":"thm-martingale-maximal-inequality — 上鞅最大不等式","depends_on":["[[43-df-supermartingale]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-thm-martingale-prefixfree-inequality]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.1.1 Theorem 10.1.4(ii)，印刷206–207，PDF226–227","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-martingale-maximal-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-martingale-maximal-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-martingale-maximal-inequality — 上鞅最大不等式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e70aa52bbf815a8\" href=\"?note=4e70aa52bbf815a8\" title=\"43-df-supermartingale\">43-df-supermartingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2cc5f0641c3417d\" href=\"?note=f2cc5f0641c3417d\" title=\"43-thm-martingale-prefixfree-inequality\">43-thm-martingale-prefixfree-inequality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.1 Theorem 10.1.4(ii)，印刷206–207，PDF226–227"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是非负上鞅（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e70aa52bbf815a8\" href=\"?note=4e70aa52bbf815a8\" title=\"43-df-supermartingale\">43-df-supermartingale</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&gt;0\">\\(a&gt;0\\)</span> 为实数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为固定的公平硬币测度，柱集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma:d(\\sigma)&gt;a}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le\\frac{d(\\varepsilon)}a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma:d(\\sigma)&gt;a}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le\\frac{d(\\varepsilon)}a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选择首次超过a的前缀，构成前缀自由族，再用资本不等式。采用&gt;而非≥可直接用于下半可计算d的有效开检验。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1.1 Theorem 10.1.4(ii)，印刷206–207，PDF226–227。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-supermartingale","status":"resolved","id":"4e70aa52bbf815a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-supermartingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-martingale-prefixfree-inequality","status":"resolved","id":"f2cc5f0641c3417d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-martingale-prefixfree-inequality]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-supermartingale","status":"resolved","id":"4e70aa52bbf815a8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d$ 是非负上鞅（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$a>0$ 为实数；$\\varepsilon$ 是空串，$\\mu$ 为固定的公平硬币测度，柱集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d$ 是非负上鞅（see [[43-df-supermartingale]]），$a>0$ 为实数；$\\varepsilon$ 是空串，$\\mu$ 为固定的公平硬币测度，柱集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 在 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 $\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"a>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma:d(\\sigma)>a}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le\\frac{d(\\varepsilon)}a.","display":true}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-martingale-maximal-inequality]] — 上鞅最大不等式"}],"outgoing":["4e70aa52bbf815a8","8e999d59227f4a28","ab1ef7b1cac112c1","f2cc5f0641c3417d"]}